summary.label:
Do you drink enough water every day? Are you thirsty to drink water? Do you often forget to drink water because of busy work? 

Why we need to take enough water every day?

1.Keep health: water is calorie free;
2.Good for skin: drinking enough water increases elasticity of skin, prevents aging, flushes out toxins;
3.Water is an ally for those who're losing weight;
4.Stay hydrated: People need to take water after sport such as:swimming, yoga, football, fitness etc.

[iDrink] is an app to build a new healthy habit by reminding you to drink on time and tell help you how to drink water more healthy! 

[Main function]
1.Calculate the daily goal water you need to take base on the information of age,lifestyle,weight;

2.freedom to customize specific drinking time and timely push to set the reminder time;

3.Make your drink plane:By recording your daily drinking water,you can urge yourself to drink while getting a certain incentive and it will help you to build a good healthy habit to drink water every day;

4.Data analysis: The analysis of the data can help you to check your past drinking water situation and make the most suitable adjustments in real time;

5.We recommended a “water table" to provide you with a reference;

6. Custom push tips support and free ringtones to use.
